"""LAN simulator: a small virtual network (a router, a Wi-Fi extender, a few phones and a copy of Vedetta) used to reproduce, quickly and in a repeatable way,
the cases that make one phone appear as two cards. Only the pure parts (packets, schedules, measures) run everywhere; the network itself needs Linux and root
(see tools/lansim/README.md). Every name, MAC and address in this package is made up."""
